WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.870
- These are the new Apple AirTags.

00:00:01.870 --> 00:00:03.080
You can connect it to your phone

00:00:03.080 --> 00:00:05.050
so if you lose your keys or something,

00:00:05.050 --> 00:00:06.205
you can play a sound.

00:00:06.205 --> 00:00:07.038
(AirTag beeping)

00:00:07.038 --> 00:00:08.270
Or if you have the iPhone 12,

00:00:08.270 --> 00:00:10.130
or a phone that is U1 enabled,

00:00:10.130 --> 00:00:11.840
you'll be able to use precision tracking.

00:00:11.840 --> 00:00:15.320
I can just walk around my
house until I've found my keys.

00:00:15.320 --> 00:00:16.210
It's here!

00:00:16.210 --> 00:00:17.830
Here's a few of the
accessories that you can get

00:00:17.830 --> 00:00:19.050
to put your AirTags in.

00:00:19.050 --> 00:00:21.670
The key chain, a little
loop, and the leather loop.

00:00:21.670 --> 00:00:23.240
These just snap, just like that,

00:00:23.240 --> 00:00:24.073
and you can pop out

00:00:24.073 --> 00:00:25.600
(AirTag clanking)
your AirTag.

00:00:25.600 --> 00:00:26.920
And another cool thing,

00:00:26.920 --> 00:00:28.963
you can customize them with emojis.

